I don't feel like we have to explain

00:35:11.149 --> 00:35:16.007
why that seems kinda
just dirty and deceptive.

00:35:16.007 --> 00:35:18.830
I understand that, listen, I get it,

00:35:18.830 --> 00:35:20.320
we sell things all the time,

00:35:20.320 --> 00:35:23.397
we just tried to sell you
some stuff at Mythical.com,

00:35:23.397 --> 00:35:27.070
